        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions MBR-833KR Decorative Victorian Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis very decorative victorian design door handle is <b>1-3/16\" Diameter</b> with a <b>3\" projection</b>.  They are hand made and finished in the USA. Each one is unique with its own character.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Victorian design door pull is reminiscent of the late 1800's, very elaborate yet graceful, that embellished the european homes of the noble and wealthy. Can be used on metal, glass, composite or wood doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/decorative-reed-cabinet-knob-and-rose-first-impressions-833k-833kr\"><b>Cabinet Knobs</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/ornate-victorian-floor-door-stop-first-impressions-918r-f\"><b>Victorian Door Stop</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions MBR-833KR Decorative Victorian Door Handle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Rosette Diameter: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 5</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<li>FII-MBR-833KR-14: Total Length 14\" - Center to Center Mount - 12-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-MBR-833KR-16: Total Length 16\" - Center to Center Mount - 14-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-MBR-833KR-18: Total Length 18\" - Center to Center Mount - 16-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-MBR-833KR-20: Total Length 20\" - Center to Center Mount - 18-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-MBR-833KR-24: Total Length 24\" - Center to Center Mount - 22-3/8\"</li>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This decorative door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Decorative Victorian Door Pull, First Impressions MBR-833KR",
                "description": "First Impressions MBR-833KR Decorative Victorian Refrigerator Handles. This very decorative victorian design appliance handle is 1-3/16 inch Diameter with a 3-1/4 inch projection.  They are hand made in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions in your choice of 5 standard finishes. This appliance pull is available in 5 different standard lengths of 14 - 24 inches.",
                "keywords": "FII-MBR-833KR Decorative Victorian Door Pulls, First Impressions MBR-833KR Decorative Victorian Door Handles, Victorian Reed Door Pulls, victorian design door handles, FII-MBR-833KR-14 14 inch Door handles, FII-MBR-833KR-16 16 inch Door handles, FII-MBR-833KR-18 18 inch Door handles, FII-MBR-833KR-20 20 inch Door handles, FII-MBR-833KR-24 24 inch Door handles,"
